	(text "Connector outputs: B -> BAT54S clamp to +5V/GND -> 470 Ohm -> pin 1. J102/J103 Micro-Fit (keyed), J104/J105 2.54 mm headers (0.5 A budget), J106 ESC with pin 2 (BEC +) not connected."
